  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You attack from the shadows of bush and reed and silently pass by the corpses you leave. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls you make with blowguns.</li><li>When you wield a blowgun, its damage die is increased by one size (i.e. 1d4 => 1d6).</li><li>You ignore the loading property of blowguns.</li><li>When you have successfully taken the hide action, you do not give away your position when making an attack with your blowgun, regardless of whether or not the attack hits.</li></ul>",
